TITLE_PERIPHERAL_INFO=Peripheral type & serial number
HELP_PERIPHERAL_INFO=Peripheral type is a fixed firmware constant (always URTC) and can't be changed. Serial number is a host-assigned label for telling multiple boards apart on the same CAN bus - default 0, any value 0-255 is valid.
LBL_NEW_SERIAL=New serial:
LOG_PERIPHERAL_NO_RESPONSE=Peripheral type/serial: no response (older firmware, or board not connected).
