LOG_DEVICE_SERIAL_SAVED_CONFIRMED=Device serial number saved and confirmed: {serial}
LOG_DEVICE_SERIAL_MISMATCH=Device serial number set to {value}, but board reports {confirmed} - the write may not have taken. Query again to check.
